// selectedDocBox filter stream (section 7.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 7.2 Bubble selection, boxed snippet, PDF page 46 (printed page 45)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

selectedDocBox <-
  when
    TopContainer.haloTarget :box
  then
    if box && this.boxBelongsToDoc(box) || box == nil
      box
    else
      undefined

// Transcription notes
// - Text layer vs image: no glyph differences found in this listing.
// - Spacing: indentation and alignment come from glyph positions, checked against the page image.
// - The condition reads 'box && this.boxBelongsToDoc(box) || box == nil' with no parentheses, as printed (Appendix I has parentheses).
// - Uncertain glyphs: none.
